## Chapter 1 — Types (`src/types/types.ts`)

### File details
- **Path:** `src/types/types.ts`
- **Command:** Create file

### Code block by block

```ts
export type MessageRole = 'system' | 'user' | 'assistant' | 'tool';
```
Defines the four message roles used in conversation history. A Message object carries `role` + `content`.

```ts
export interface Message { role: MessageRole; content: string; }
```
Single turn in the conversation history.

```ts
export interface ToolResult { toolCallId?: string; content: string; }
```
Result returned by a tool after execution. `toolCallId` links result back to the tool call.

```ts
export interface LLMEngine { generate(messages: Message[], options?: Record<string, unknown>): Promise<string>; }
```
Abstraction over LLM provider. The Agent SDK only needs `generate()`; any provider can be plugged in.

```ts
export interface Instructions { systemPrompt?: string; outputSchema?: unknown; }
```
Harness/system prompt and optional structured output schema.

```ts
export interface ITool { name: string; description: string; execute(args: Record<string, unknown>): Promise<ToolResult>; }
```
Tool contract: unique `name`, human `description`, and `execute` that takes args and returns a ToolResult.

